      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "Instructor: Welcome back to the recipe book.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 6.96,
          "en": "We already used NGF and NG four in the section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "so we're already using directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 12.12,
          "en": "but now I want to enhance this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.12,
          "end": 14.13,
          "en": "by adding our own directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.13,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "which allows us to open the dropdowns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 20.19,
          "en": "which don't work as of now if you click them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 21.023,
          "en": "They don't work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.023,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "because we didn't import bootstrap's JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.18,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "And I don't want to import this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "because Angular should be the only thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 30.03,
          "en": "interacting with my dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.03,
          "end": 31.83,
          "en": "But now with the directive knowledge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.83,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "we can create our own directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 36.543,
          "en": "which will manipulate these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.95,
          "en": "I'll add the directive in the shared folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.95,
          "end": 42.663,
          "en": "and I will name it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "dropdown directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "So the file is named dropdown directive.ts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 53.4,
          "en": "Of course you could use tc to create it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.4,
          "end": 55.77,
          "en": "and you could even point to the shared folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 58.41,
          "en": "in the command to automatically generate it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.41,
          "end": 60.87,
          "en": "in this shared folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 61.98,
          "en": "I'll do it manually though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 62.813,
          "en": "Always a good practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.813,
          "end": 67.794,
          "en": "and here the name should be DropdownDirective like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "And of course we need to add a decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 74.76,
          "en": "to turn this into a directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.76,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "So it's the @Directive decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "which needs to be imported from @Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 84.092,
          "en": "And here there is one thing I need to set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.092,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "on the selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 89.01,
          "en": "I want to define how I can add my directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.01,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "and I will use an attribute selector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 94.53,
          "en": "therefore I'll enclose the name in square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.53,
          "end": 98.19,
          "en": "The name now will be [appDropdown].",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "To have a unique name which doesn't accidentally interfere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 104.37,
          "en": "with an officially existing attribute name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.37,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.87,
          "en": "Now, what should this directive do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.87,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "I want to add some functionality to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "which allows us to add a certain CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "to the element it sits on, once it is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 121.59,
          "en": "So once this element, the directive sits on, is clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.59,
          "end": 125.76,
          "en": "and remove the class once we click again, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.76,
          "end": 127.41,
          "en": "So this is your challenge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.41,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "Try implementing such a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "which basically listens to clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 133.47,
          "en": "and then toggles some property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.47,
          "end": 136.17000000000002,
          "en": "which determines whether some class is attached us or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.17000000000002,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "And also try implementing some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 142.05,
          "en": "which dynamically attaches a CSS class or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "Before you actually start though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 146.97,
          "en": "let's find out which class we need to attach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 149.94,
          "en": "If you go to the recipe detail component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 149.94,
          "end": 153.75,
          "en": "if you attach the open CSS class to the Diff",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.75,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "which holds button group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 158.91,
          "en": "and you go to your application, and select the recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.91,
          "end": 162.45,
          "en": "You see now, it looks like the dropdown was opened.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.45,
          "end": 164.82,
          "en": "So it's this open CSS class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.82,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "The same for the usage in an a header we need to attach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "So that's your challenge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "Build a dropdown directive which attaches this class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 174.18,
          "en": "whenever we click on it or removes it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 175.893,
          "en": "once we click a second time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.29,
          "end": 180.9,
          "en": "Let's build this directive together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 185.9,
          "en": "So as explained, I want to toggle it upon clicking this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.06,
          "end": 188.55,
          "en": "So (indistinct) listen to a click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.55,
          "end": 191.46,
          "en": "I should add Host Listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "which is to be imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 197.25,
          "en": "And I want to listen to a Click event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.25,
          "end": 201.36,
          "en": "Then I want to execute toggle Open, which looks like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "or sounds like a fitting name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 204.57,
          "en": "because that is what I want to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 204.57,
          "end": 207.543,
          "en": "I want to toggle whether this should be opened or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 208.92000000000002,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "Well, then I will add isOpen directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.24,
          "en": "which I'll set to false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 216.24,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "And in my host listener I'll simply set open or is open to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 222.66,
          "en": "well, what it is currently not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 222.66,
          "end": 224.46,
          "en": "So if isOpen was true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 224.46,
          "end": 227.403,
          "en": "it'll now be set to false and the other way around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.42000000000002,
          "end": 233.07,
          "en": "So with that, I'm toggling that property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 233.07,
          "end": 237.96,
          "en": "now to dynamically attach or detach a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.96,
          "end": 239.322,
          "en": "depending on this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.322,
          "end": 243.51,
          "en": "all I have to do is, I'll add host binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.51,
          "end": 246,
          "en": "which needs to be imported from Angular Core",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246,
          "end": 249.81,
          "en": "and allows us to bind to properties of the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.81,
          "end": 252.15,
          "en": "the directive is placed on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 252.15,
          "end": 256.98,
          "en": "And here, I want to bind to the class property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.98,
          "end": 260.13,
          "en": "of that element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.13,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "Class, simply is an array of all the classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 267.63,
          "en": "And here it's all about this open class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.63,
          "end": 269.34,
          "en": "As you learned, that's the CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.34,
          "end": 272.01,
          "en": "we need to attach dynamically or detach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.01,
          "end": 274.83,
          "en": "and now the rest will be handled by Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 274.83,
          "end": 277.40999999999997,
          "en": "Since a bind to is open,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.40999999999997,
          "end": 279.75,
          "en": "this will not be attached initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.75,
          "end": 283.02,
          "en": "whenever is open, switches to true, it will be attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 283.02,
          "end": 286.02,
          "en": "and whenever it switches to false, it will be removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.02,
          "end": 289.02,
          "en": "And that's our entire directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 289.02,
          "end": 292.65,
          "en": "Now, to be able to use it, I need to go to app module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 292.65,
          "end": 296.46,
          "en": "and add it here, add the dropdown directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 296.46,
          "end": 299.673,
          "en": "and add the import pointing to the shared folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 300.78,
          "end": 305.25,
          "en": "And with that imported, now I can use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.25,
          "end": 308.43,
          "en": "I can use it in the detail component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 308.43,
          "end": 310.38,
          "en": "I have to use it on the dev or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 310.38,
          "end": 313.35,
          "en": "on the element where open should be attached to in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 313.35,
          "end": 316.26,
          "en": "So in this case, the dev with the button group class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 316.26,
          "end": 319.44,
          "en": "And here I'll add my own app dropdown directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 319.44,
          "end": 322.35,
          "en": "without squared brackets without assigning any value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.35,
          "end": 323.76,
          "en": "because, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 323.76,
          "end": 326.88,
          "en": "I don't need to configure anything on this directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 326.88,
          "end": 328.255,
          "en": "And now in the header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.255,
          "end": 330.383,
          "en": "here, the place where I need to add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 330.383,
          "end": 333.57,
          "en": "is this list item with the class of dropdown.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 333.57,
          "end": 336.51,
          "en": "Here this is what will actually need the open class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 336.51,
          "end": 337.653,
          "en": "to show something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 338.58,
          "end": 341.13,
          "en": "With that in place, and ng serves still running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 341.13,
